{
  "bookId": "rewind-5",
  "id": "source-3135",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3135001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "她什么时候能醒过来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "外层的涂装已经彻底被清除干净，她很快就能醒过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "咳……樱这是在哪里……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱，你醒了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "还能认出我来吗，我是谁？她又是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "尤娜姐姐……小惠姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "对对对对！我是你的尤娜姐姐！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "樱，你能醒过来真好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "樱你……你还记得我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "你、你不要过来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "樱，我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "走开！不要过来！尤娜姐姐，小惠姐姐，帮帮樱好不好，呜呜呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "樱，你全身都在发抖……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你竟然……这么害怕莉可吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱变成这样子全是你害的，你别再靠近她了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我知道了，我会离开的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "只是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "樱，你能恢复原来的样子，我真的很高兴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "再见了，樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才一段日子不见，玲的技术日渐精进到这种地步，真是对你越来越刮目相看了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我这些都是跟着主人学来的，不算厉害的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "太谦虚啦，有了这个涂装清洁剂，不知道能拯救多少像樱一样被害的手办~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "玲，你真的是个天才！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "能帮到你们，是我的荣幸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，我们现在就出发去天启的大本营吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我要用玲研制的这种清洁剂，把那些被天启狂化的手办都救出来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "还他们自己本来的面目。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "优纪，你的这份勇气真是令我佩服。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没、没有啦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我只是不想看到其他手办遭遇同样的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱……樱也想去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这太危险了，樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "可是，没有谁比樱更清楚被神秘涂料伤害的滋味……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "所以，樱想要阻止更多像樱一样的手办受伤害……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "好，我和小惠会一直陪着你的，樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3135041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那么我们就出发前往废弃工厂了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
